  "tips": [
    "Always hunt with Gina. Her level 5 skill cuts the stamina cost from 10 to 8 per Beast and from 25 to 20 per Polar Terror.",
    "A Polar Terror is the better value: 3 points cost 20 stamina, while 3 Beasts cost 24.",
    "Do not finish the 16:00 UTC Intel mission, the one with only Beasts, the day before the event. Do it after the event starts.",
    "Use the Ultra Value Monthly Card for stamina. It gives 600 stamina cans (6,000 stamina) and automatic hunting.",
    "Turn on auto-join to join rallies in your alliance.",
    "Gen 7 and above states get Charm Guides and Charm Designs as milestone rewards and Mythic General Decoration Components in the ranking."
  ]
